{"version":1,"content":"<p>外交部發言人毛寧今（15日）宣布，國務院總理李強將於周六（17日）至下周四（22 日）先後訪問烏茲別克、塔吉克及俄羅斯，其間出席上海合作組織（上合組織）會議，及中俄總理定期會晤。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-15T09:02:27.632899+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":89,"images":0,"source":"明報 中國","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-15T08:15:42+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-15T15:38:12.708470+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-15T08:57:38.183184+00:00","content_hash":"55cc977a847be73c7a829179e19415dc7d4f2e765602c03918906ab249766f56","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}